WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:16.501
was once again traveling west with the Tang Monk.

2
00:00:19.483 --> 00:00:20.223
said Wukong.

3
00:00:20.243 --> 00:00:23.665
"While I was at Mount Potalaka, I thought a lot.

4
00:00:24.866 --> 00:00:26.807
realize now that it's wrong to harm people.

5
00:00:27.407 --> 00:00:30.164
I won't ever do it again."

6
00:00:30.304 --> 00:00:32.126
"I'm glad, Wukong," said the Tang Monk.

7
00:00:34.228 --> 00:00:35.749
we please slow down?"

8
00:00:36.089 --> 00:00:37.070
Bajie moaned.

9
00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:39.412
"I'm tired and it's hot!"

10
00:00:41.354 --> 00:00:42.275
Wukong laughed.

11
00:00:42.955 --> 00:00:44.297
much has changed since I left.

12
00:00:45.017 --> 00:00:47.439
Bajie still complains all the time!"

13
00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:50.222
Wujing wiped his brow.

14
00:00:52.003 --> 00:00:54.265
hot. Maybe we should take a break."

15
00:00:55.546 --> 00:00:57.148
"Yes," said the Tang Monk.

16
00:00:58.424 --> 00:01:00.205
I don't understand why it's so hot.

17
00:01:00.905 --> 00:01:01.665
It's not summer."

18
00:01:03.766 --> 00:01:05.587
The travelers soon reached a village.

19
00:01:07.848 --> 00:01:10.389
An old man offered to take them in for the night.

20
00:01:12.830 --> 00:01:15.191
Later that evening they were all eating dinner.

21
00:01:15.211 --> 00:01:18.892
"Is it always so hot here?"

22
00:01:19.232 --> 00:01:20.033
asked Bajie.

23
00:01:21.493 --> 00:01:22.214
man nodded.

24
00:01:22.234 --> 00:01:24.755
"The Mountain of Flames is near here.

25
00:01:24.775 --> 00:01:29.344
It's always burning."

26
00:01:29.424 --> 00:01:33.247
"Well, I'll be happy when we continue on our journey," said the pig.

27
00:01:33.267 --> 00:01:36.169
"Then we can get away from this heat."

28
00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:39.292
"Where are you going?"

29
00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:40.272
asked the man.

30
00:01:40.292 --> 00:01:44.375
"We're going to the Western Paradise," said the Tang Monk.

31
00:01:45.416 --> 00:01:46.337
man frowned.

32
00:01:46.357 --> 00:01:49.139
"You can't travel west from here."

33
00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:53.081
Everyone stopped eating and looked at the old man.

34
00:01:53.102 --> 00:01:54.883
"Why not?"

35
00:01:55.363 --> 00:01:56.304
asked the Tang Monk.

36
00:01:57.556 --> 00:02:00.878
"The Mountain of Flames is to the west," said the man.

37
00:02:00.898 --> 00:02:03.760
"It's impossible to pass."

38
00:02:03.780 --> 00:02:07.121
"We'll go around it," said the Tang Monk.

39
00:02:08.302 --> 00:02:09.803
The old man shook his head.

40
00:02:09.823 --> 00:02:15.726
"All the land around the mountain is covered in flames.

41
00:02:16.607 --> 00:02:19.328
The land stretches far to the north and the south.

42
00:02:20.389 --> 00:02:22.390
It's impossible to go around."

43
00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:27.413
"Then we must wait for a strong rainstorm," said Bajie.

44
00:02:27.433 --> 00:02:29.474
"That will put out the flames."

45
00:02:30.794 --> 00:02:32.055
"No," said the man.

46
00:02:32.996 --> 00:02:34.236
flames are magical.

47
00:02:35.137 --> 00:02:37.778
There is just one spirit who can put them out."

48
00:02:39.079 --> 00:02:40.399
"Who?" asked Wujing.

49
00:02:40.419 --> 00:02:44.802
"She's called the Iron Immortal," said the man.

50
00:02:44.822 --> 00:02:48.564
"She has a special fan that can put out the flames.

51
00:02:49.464 --> 00:02:51.185
It's made from a plantain leaf."

52
00:02:53.406 --> 00:02:53.847
stood up.

53
00:02:53.867 --> 00:02:56.960
"Where does the Iron Immortal live?

54
00:02:57.020 --> 00:02:58.801
I'll demand that she put out the flames."

55
00:03:00.342 --> 00:03:02.602
won't listen to you," said the man.

56
00:03:02.622 --> 00:03:05.023
"She is very powerful."

57
00:03:05.964 --> 00:03:08.665
Wukong folded his arms in front of his chest.

58
00:03:09.705 --> 00:03:11.306
am as powerful as a god.

59
00:03:12.146 --> 00:03:13.747
Just tell me where she lives."

60
00:03:15.028 --> 00:03:18.269
The old man told Wukong where the Iron Immortal lived.

61
00:03:19.389 --> 00:03:20.990
The monkey leaped into the air.

62
00:03:24.651 --> 00:03:25.692
The man gasped.

63
00:03:26.112 --> 00:03:27.593
"He's a spirit!"

64
00:03:30.055 --> 00:03:32.838
Wukong was soon on the Iron Immortal's mountain.

65
00:03:34.779 --> 00:03:36.601
He found a cave door and knocked.

66
00:03:36.621 --> 00:03:38.382
"Open up!"

67
00:03:38.642 --> 00:03:39.263
he demanded.

68
00:03:40.464 --> 00:03:42.846
door flew open, and a tall woman appeared.

69
00:03:43.586 --> 00:03:45.047
She held a large fan.

70
00:03:46.008 --> 00:03:46.709
"Who are you?"

71
00:03:47.129 --> 00:03:47.669
she asked.

72
00:03:49.391 --> 00:03:50.472
am Sun Wukong.

73
00:03:50.952 --> 00:03:52.193
I need to borrow your fan.

74
00:03:53.994 --> 00:03:56.088
Wukong? Ugh!"

75
00:03:56.108 --> 00:03:57.189
cried the Iron Immortal.

76
00:03:58.229 --> 00:03:59.730
"You are my worst enemy!"

77
00:04:00.851 --> 00:04:02.191
Wukong was confused.

78
00:04:02.211 --> 00:04:02.952
"I am?

79
00:04:03.412 --> 00:04:07.194
Why?" The Iron Immortal glared at the monkey.

80
00:04:07.214 --> 00:04:11.897
"My husband is the Bull Demon King, who used to be your friend.

81
00:04:12.777 --> 00:04:14.558
And our son is Red Boy.

82
00:04:15.719 --> 00:04:20.001
Because of you, Red Boy is a prisoner of the bodhisattva Guanyin!"

83
00:04:22.642 --> 00:04:23.603
Wukong laughed.

84
00:04:24.003 --> 00:04:25.464
"Red Boy isn't a prisoner.

85
00:04:26.668 --> 00:04:27.849
is Guanyin's student.

86
00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:29.811
He isn't evil anymore."

87
00:04:34.113 --> 00:04:35.294
Iron Immortal shrieked.

88
00:04:35.314 --> 00:04:36.635
"That's even worse!"

89
00:04:39.277 --> 00:04:43.140
sighed. "Can I please just borrow your fan for a little while?"

90
00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:45.782
"No!" said the woman.

91
00:04:45.802 --> 00:04:50.305
"Well then, can I speak with the Bull Demon King?"

92
00:04:50.585 --> 00:04:51.285
asked the monkey.

93
00:04:51.305 --> 00:04:54.788
"He's at a banquet," said the Iron Immortal.

94
00:04:55.432 --> 00:04:56.113
"Now leave!"

95
00:04:59.157 --> 00:04:59.898
grew angry.

96
00:04:59.918 --> 00:05:08.569
"I'm not leaving until I borrow The Iron Immortal waved the fan.

97
00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:13.115
A furious wind blew, and Wukong was gone!
